(22240, 1033, 3122, 'Dear Sir/Madam,\r\n\r\nGreetings from Visa Experts! \r\n\r\nWe are pleased to invite you to an exclusive Visa & Immigration Seminar by Kaveesh Sir, where you will receive valuable guidance on various visa and work opportunities.\r\n\r\nIn this seminar, you will learn about:\r\n\r\n1.Visitor Visa – How to apply and improve your chances of approval\r\n2. Visit-to-Work Options – How you can explore opportunities to transition from a visit to work, where legally permitted\r\n3. Direct Work Visa – Guidance on work visa pathways and requirements\r\n4. Visa on a Low Budget – How to plan your visa process smartly and explore affordable options\r\n5. Expert guidance on choosing the right visa pathway according to your profile\r\n\r\nThis is a great opportunity to get your questions answered and understand the best options for your future.\r\n\r\n Book your seat today! Limited seats are available.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to welcoming you to this informative seminar!', NULL, 'Unread', 'No', '2026-08-13 12:57:20', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL);
